  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IWcKm5r.gif\" alt=\"快速爬梯範例\" width=\"800\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/spoorn/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &amp;message=其他作品&amp;color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &amp;message=其他作品&amp;color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"175\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/xfddZwG898\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://tinyurl.com/spoorndiscordbadge\" alt=\"https://tinyurl.com/spoorndiscordbadge\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornPacks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornPacks?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=github &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornPacks?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=github &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornPacks/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornPacks?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=issues &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornPacks?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=issues &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">非常簡單且高效的模組，讓你能更快爬梯子。也應該能與其他攀爬機制（如藤蔓）相容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">放開移動按鍵，看向上方可更快往上爬，看向下方可更快往下爬。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">速度可在 <code>config/ClimbLaddersFast.json5</code> 中設定，說明文件請見 <a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/ClimbLaddersFast/blob/main/config-documentation.json5\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/spoorn/ClimbLaddersFast/blob/main/config-documentation.json5</a>，或若安裝 Mod Menu，也可在遊戲內選單進行設定。本模組僅需安裝在客戶端。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ui9WAwu.png\" alt=\"模組選單\" width=\"800\" height=\"96\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需求</span></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HabVZJR.png\" alt=\"需要 Fabric\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\">&nbsp;（Fabric 版本）</p><p>- 也需要 Cloth Config API：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config</a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2>需要伺服器嗎？</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fspoorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KPURPK0.png\" alt=\"https://bisecthosting.com/spoorn\" width=\"1000\" height=\"158\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
